# Homepage — frontend

- Static HTML/CSS/JS under `homepage/` (no bundler required). Keep the 1990s listing look intentional, not a parody dump.
- Project rows come from `projects.json` — prefer editing that file over hard-coding rows in HTML.
- Escape user/content strings when rendering into the DOM (`app.js` helpers).
- Version assets with `?v=` query params on HTML references; bump when shipping CSS/JS changes.
- Imprint stays lightweight static HTML.
